    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Sheltering Hands<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Recruit</p><p>A kitchen that cooks large quantities of food and serves it to the hungry.</p><p><strong>Recruit: Kitchen Operation.</strong> The hireling runs the soup kitchen for 7 days; ingredients cost 50 GP. If the next roll on the Bastion Events table would make you lose a Bastion Defender or a hireling, someone who believes in your work steps in and takes their place: you don't lose them.</p><p><strong>Traveling Snacks.</strong> After a Long Rest in your Bastion, you gain a magical Charm that lasts for 7 days or until you use it, letting you cast Goodberry once without expending a spell slot.</p><p><em>Source: Arcana Unleashed.</em></p>",
